[M2] (golly 4.1)
#R B3-jknr4ity5ijk6i8/S23-a4city6c7c
#C fangtian-p72-lepagun.mc.gz
#C GUYTU6J, January 2022
#C
#C Fangtian is a unit cell (or metacell) designed in an isotropic
#C non-totalistic rule named Glimmering Garden by GUYTU6J. It is a
#C more compact equivalent of Adam P. Goucher's p1 megacell, made
#C possible thanks to moderately developed stable signal circuitry
#C and an efficient blinker-pulling device for neighbour calculation.
#C With a period of 262144 ticks and a unit bounding box of 8192x8192,
#C it should run smoothly in HashLife.
#C 
#C The following pattern is a capped period-72 gun that fires lepa,
#C a small knightship, in another non-totalistic rule known as
#C LeapLife. It was originally built by FWKnightship and reduced here
#C to fit in an area of 80x120:
#C https://conwaylife.com/forums/viewtopic.php?f=11&t=4267&p=122908#p122908
#C
#C A summary for the rule can be found at this wiki page:
#C https://conwaylife.com/wiki/User:GUYTU6J/OCA:Glimmering_Garden
